From a982620d299e7332c69e16fd061919959d03b767 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xavier Geerinck <xavier.geerinck@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 16:41:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 16/27] refactor(sandbox): move ActorType to
 pkg/components/sandbox

The sandbox actor type name is needed by the API layer (routing in
universal, the CallActor ACL in pkg/api/grpc) and by the runtime host.
It lived in pkg/runtime/sandboxhost, so workflow_acl.go imported a
runtime package for a string helper. It now lives in the leaf component
package that every user already imports.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
